<!--
  The same mark, for the notification and for whatever the launcher draws beside a book
  that is playing. Without it Media3 supplies its own, which is a musical note - wrong
  twice over, since this is neither music nor anyone else's app.

  Scaled up from the launcher drawing: an adaptive icon holds its shape inside a safe
  circle that a mask cuts into, and a notification icon has no mask, so the same drawing
  at the same size would sit in a box of empty room. Android renders this by its alpha
  alone and tints it, so the colours below only have to be opaque.
-->
